          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Yeehuu sidaasuu Bacal uga baabbi'iyey dalka Israa'iil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habase yeeshee dembiyadii Yaaraabcaam ina Nebaad kii dadka Israa'iil dembaajiyey Yeehuu kama hadhin, kuwaasoo ahaa weylihii dahabka ahaa ee dhex yiil Beytel iyo Daan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Rabbigu wuxuu Yeehuu ku yidhi, Si wanaagsan baad u yeeshay wax hortayda ku toosan, oo reerkii Axaabna waad ku samaysay wax alla wixii qalbigayga ku jiray oo dhan, haddaba sidaas daraaddeed farcankaaga qarniga afraad ah ayaa ku fadhiisan doona carshiga dalka Israa'iil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse Yeehuu iskama uu jirin oo kuma socon sharcigii Rabbiga ah Ilaaha reer binu Israa'iil, kumana raacin qalbigiisa oo dhan, oo kama tegin dembiyadii Yaaraabcaam uu dadka Israa'iil dembaajiyey.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
