              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waagaas ayaa Rabbigu bilaabay inuu dalka Israa'iil yareeyo, oo Xasaa'eel ayaa iyaga ku laayay dalka Israa'iil oo dhan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo laga bilaaba Webi Urdun ilaa barigiisa, intaas oo ah dalka Gilecaad oo dhan, iyo reer Gaad, iyo reer Ruubeen, iyo reer Manaseh, iyo tan iyo Carooceerta ku ag taal Webi Arnoon, iyo xataa Gilecaad iyo Baashaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
